  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Coastal Station Data from Station Xiao Chang Shan, China in China Real Time Data Base (RTDB) for NEAR-GOOS",
  "description": "Station data, collected from Station Xiao Chang Shan, are provided by NMEFC (National Research Center for Marine Environmental Forecasts) of China and NMDIS (National Marine Data and Information Services) of China. There are three types of data: 1) coastal station temperature and salinity data; 2) coastal station wave and wind data; and 3) station data. Data can be downloaded from the China Delayed Mode Data Base for NEAR-GOOS. First time users must register to gain database access.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: The National Marine Data and Information Service of China (NMDIS) has developed and maintained China Delayed Mode Data Base for NEAR-GOOS (CDMDB) to offer basic data service to NEAR-GOOS and GOOS communities.",
  "url": "https://zenodo.org/records/23569377",
